# Remaps the Worker used to do (src/index.ts serveAsset), now handled by the
# Assets layer so these high-traffic paths serve WITHOUT invoking the Worker.
# 200 = rewrite (serve target content at the original URL); 301 = redirect.

# Homepage is the DESAPARECIDOS registry. Target the clean URL (not *.html) so
# html_handling serves personas.html in place rather than 30x-ing on the .html.
/                /personas        200

# /terremotos (old earthquake dashboard = index.html) is served by the WORKER —
# see run_worker_first in wrangler.toml. A _redirects rewrite to /index.html gets
# normalized to "/" by html_handling and wrongly lands on personas.

# Legacy La Guaira deep-link → generalized state template (dynamic, Worker-owned).
/la-guaira       /estado/la-guaira  301
